  "privacy.lastUpdated": "Last updated: February 26, 2026",
  "privacy.section1Body": "Bakle (the \"Service\") collects the following personal information.\n\n• Email address (on sign-up and login)\n• Google account info (name and email, when signing in with Google)\n• Recipe data you create (text, images)\n• Profile info (handle, avatar)\n• Subscription and payment status",
  "privacy.section1Title": "1. Information We Collect",
  "privacy.section2Body": "Your information is used for the following purposes.\n\n• Identifying members and authenticating access\n• Syncing recipe data across devices\n• Verifying subscription status and providing paid features\n• Improving the service and resolving issues",
  "privacy.section2Title": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "privacy.section3Body": "Your personal information is retained while you use the service and deleted without delay when you request account deletion. Data stored only on your device is not collected on our servers.",
  "privacy.section3Title": "3. Data Retention and Deletion",
  "privacy.section4Body": "We do not share your personal information with third parties without your consent. However, data is processed through the following service providers.\n\n• Firebase (Google) — authentication, data storage, image hosting\n• RevenueCat — subscription billing management\n• Google AdMob — ad display (free users)",
  "privacy.section4Title": "4. Sharing with Third Parties",
  "privacy.section5Body": "You may exercise the following rights at any time.\n\n• Export your recipe data (JSON format)\n• Request account and data deletion\n• Update your info (handle, profile)",
  "privacy.section5Title": "5. Your Rights",
  "privacy.section6Body": "We protect your data using Firebase security rules and HTTPS-encrypted communication. However, no method over the internet can guarantee complete security.",
  "privacy.section6Title": "6. Data Security",
  "privacy.section7Body": "We do not use our own cookies. The ad service (AdMob) may use its own tracking technologies, which are governed by that service's privacy policy.",
  "privacy.section7Title": "7. Cookies and Tracking",
  "privacy.section8Body": "This policy may be updated as needed, and any changes will be announced within the service.",
  "privacy.section8Title": "8. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacy.section9Body": "For questions about how we handle your data, reach out via profile settings in the app or by email.",
  "privacy.section9Title": "9. Contact",
  "privacy.title": "Privacy Policy",
