  "terms.lastUpdated": "Last updated: February 15, 2026",
  "terms.section10Body": "For questions about using the Service, contact us via the in-app profile settings or email.",
  "terms.section10Title": "10. Contact",
  "terms.section1Body": "Bakle (the \"Service\") is a mobile and web application for recording, managing, and sharing baking recipes. These Terms set out the basic conditions for using the Service.",
  "terms.section1Title": "1. Service Overview",
  "terms.section2Body": "You can use the Service in local mode without signing in. Creating an account lets you sync data across devices. You must provide accurate information and are responsible for keeping your account secure.",
  "terms.section2Title": "2. Accounts and Authentication",
  "terms.section3Body": "You own all recipes, images, text, and other content you upload or save to the Service (\"User Content\"). The Service stores and processes User Content solely to provide the Service.",
  "terms.section3Title": "3. User Content",
  "terms.section4Body": "The following are prohibited:\n\n• Abusing the Service to harm other users\n• Uploading or sharing illegal content\n• Interfering with the normal operation of the Service\n• Accessing another user's account without authorization",
  "terms.section4Title": "4. Prohibited Conduct",
  "terms.section5Body": "The Service is free to use, with a paid subscription for additional features.\n\n• Subscriptions are billed through the Apple App Store and renew automatically.\n• Your subscription starts automatically when the free trial ends.\n• You can cancel your subscription in App Store settings up to 24 hours before the current billing period ends.\n• After canceling, you keep access to paid features until the end of the billing period.\n• Refunds are governed by Apple's refund policy.",
  "terms.section5Title": "5. Subscriptions and Payments",
  "terms.section6Body": "The Service securely stores your data via Firebase. The information collected is limited to your email address, recipe data, and profile information. You can export or delete your data at any time. See the Privacy Policy for details.",
  "terms.section6Title": "6. Data and Privacy",
  "terms.section7Body": "The Service may change or discontinue features after prior notice. Important changes will be announced within the Service or via your registered email.",
  "terms.section7Title": "7. Changes and Discontinuation",
  "terms.section8Body": "The Service does not guarantee the accuracy of User Content and is not liable for outcomes arising from recipe use. The Service is provided \"as is\"; while we make every effort to prevent data loss, complete assurance is not possible.",
  "terms.section8Title": "8. Disclaimer",
  "terms.section9Body": "These Terms may be updated as needed, and changes will be announced within the Service. If you do not agree to the updated Terms, you may stop using the Service.",
  "terms.section9Title": "9. Changes to These Terms",
  "terms.title": "Terms of Service",
